{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["The reason for <b>Nadab and Abihu, Eleazar and Ithamar, sons of Aaron</b> is so that one should not think that when the father is anointed to the priesthood, these sons would become priests automatically. Rather, they themselves would serve as priests in their own right. Now, Pinhas and all others born afterward are excluded, for only these four were anointed together with him, along with their descendants who would be born thereafter."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:18:46.116425816Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}